": 1842913, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13i01.jpg"}, {"id": 1842914, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc13i02.jpg"}], "slug": "where-giants-fall", "summary": "Where Giants Fall is a 3D top-down fantasy bullet-heaven action roguelite with survivors-like build growth, movement-first combat, and the thrill of turning a fragile run into overwhelming power.\n\nEvery run moves through a structured sequence of regular stages, Ritual Sieges, boss-biome encounters, and an Endless Mode finale. Auto-fire weapons keep the pressure constant, while active abilities, upgrade drafts, items, and level-10 weapon ultimates give you the timing decisions that decide whether a build stalls out or becomes unstoppable.\n\nSurvival is not just about stacking damage. You need to move well, read telegraphs, create space, and choose when to spend your strongest tools. The screen fills with enemies, projectiles, and effects, but attacks are built around readable danger patterns so you can react instead of guessing.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/where-giants-fall", "videos": [{"id": 187608, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "hy7puz7KQCs", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hy7puz7KQCs", "title": "Where Giants Fall - Official Announcement Trailer", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/hy7puz7KQCs/uhddefault.jpg"}]}